<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Aug forex reserves up at $9.523 bln.</title>
<headline>Israel's Aug forex reserves up at $9.523 bln.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Israel released the following indicator:</p>
<p>		    (In millions of dollars)</p>
<p>				   Aug 96	  July 96	   Aug 95</p>
<p>Foreign currency reserves  9,523	   8,925	     8,134</p>
<p>The government in August transferred to the central bank $920 million that was raised in the United States with the backing of U.S. loan guarantees, the Bank of Israel said.</p>
<p>This was partially offset by a decline in commercial bank deposits at the central bank.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
